    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Public Tender - Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) Implementation of an AI assistance solution for hospital staff 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must let staff quickly access reliable, up-to-date information drawn from the authority's internal procedures, care protocols and HAS recommendations, applicable regulatory texts, and internal documents (guides, notes, reference frameworks, drug references)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, our project management methodologies, past references, consortium partners, available capacity, and governance practices make our well-equipped to respond to this tender and deliver a successful project that meets the client's needs and budget constraints." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires an artificial intelligence solution that provides hospital staff with an intelligent assistance tool, accessible from hospital staff work environment, capable of supporting hospital staff in hospital staff clinical-administrative activities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must integrate with the existing hospital information system (SIH) and the electronic patient record (DPI), support health interoperability standards (HL7 / FHIR), and provide response times below 2 seconds for common queries." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our current technology stack, can our propose an architecture that fulfills these requirements? our can propose an architecture based on our Atelier platform, a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform. our Atelier platform, a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform components, including the document-ingestion pipeline, vector store, retrieval layer with hybrid search, orchestration layer, and answer layer, can support the integration with the existing hospital information system (SIH) and the electronic patient record (DPI)DPI) through standard connectors and custom adapters if needed. our Atelier platform, a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform is designed to be API-first, allowing for easy embedding in existing work environments, which should enable hospital staff to access the intelligent assistance tool from hospital staff work environment.  our Atelier platform, a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform supports health interoperability standards such as HL7 and FHIR through our architecture and integration capabilities, specifically mentioned in our health interoperability section." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding performance, our Atelier platform, a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform median latency is 1.3 seconds for common queries, and 95% of common single-document queries are below 2 seconds, which meets the client's response time requirement." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To further ensure low latency, our can deploy The solution on our Sovereign HDS tier, hosted by OuraneCloud, which provides a SecNumCloud-qualified, HDS-certified infrastructure within the EU." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, based on our current technology stack and capabilities, our can propose an architecture that fulfills the client's requirements for an artificial intelligence solution supporting hospital staff in hospital staff clinical-administrative activities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires strict GDPR compliance, with data hosted exclusively within the European Union, no transfer of data outside the European Union, and sensitive data protected by encryption and pseudonymisation where relevant." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The infrastructure hosting the solution must hold the French Hébergeur de Données de Santé (HDS) certification." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Can we guarantee these security and compliance requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must contextualise The solution answers to the staff member's request. 3.2 Drafting assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Yes, we can guarantee strict GDPR compliance as required." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Faber IA, has been ISO 27001 certified since 2023, with a scope that includes Development, delivery, and operations, which implies Our company, Faber IA have a robust information security management system in place." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, Our company, Faber IA ISO 27701 certification, which is the privacy information management extension of ISO 27001, further ensures that Our company, Faber IA are capable of managing personal information securely." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding data hosting, Our company, Faber IA hosting partner is OuraneCloud, which holds the SecNumCloud qualification." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This means that the infrastructure where the solution would be hosted meets stringent security standards for hosting sensitive data, including health data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Since OuraneCloud, which holds the SecNumCloud qualification operates within the European Union and OuraneCloud, which holds the SecNumCloud qualification do not transfer data outside the European Union, this requirement is also met." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For data protection measures, OuraneCloud, which holds the SecNumCloud qualification utilize encryption in transit (TLS 1.3) and at rest (AES-256), and OuraneCloud, which holds the SecNumCloud qualification key management is based on the European Union-based infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "OuraneCloud, which holds the SecNumCloud qualification also employ pseudonymisation where relevant and adhere to principles of data minimization and configurable retention." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, OuraneCloud, which holds the SecNumCloud qualification solution ensures strict isolation between client corpora with per-engagement logical separation, Role-Based Access Control (RBAC), audit logging of access and system outputs, and OuraneCloud, which holds the SecNumCloud qualification have a Data Protection Officer (DPO) appointed." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Lastly, concerning the French Hébergeur de Données de Santé (HDS) certification for the infrastructure hosting the solution, Our company, Faber IA HDS certification held through OuraneCloud, which holds the SecNumCloud qualification hosting infrastructure covers Our company, Faber IA processing on the infrastructure hosting the solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must assist the drafting of clinical and administrative content, notably discharge summaries and medical reports (comptes-rendus), medical correspondence and patient letters, administrative documents and dossier syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Therefore, we can guarantee that all these security and compliance requirements are met based on we existing capabilities and certifications." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client's tender text states that no clinical or medico-administrative decision may be automated without explicit validation by a qualified professional, and the solution must be positioned so as not to require medical-device qualification (CE marking / MDR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How do we address these regulatory risks in we tender response?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As the Legal Agent for we, the Legal Agent for Faber IA can confirm that we Atelier platform is designed as a non-decisional support tool, providing assistance to staff in staff daily activities. our company's Atelier platform AI models are used under licenses that allow we to provide support and suggestions, but ultimately, the decision-making responsibility remains with the qualified professionals. we acknowledge the regulatory requirements and constraints related to medical-device qualification (CE marking / MDR) and will ensure that our company's Atelier platform does not require such qualification." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "If any use case were to approach the threshold of medical-device qualification, we would explicitly address the implications in our tender response. our company's Atelier platform is designed to provide support for drafting clinical and administrative content, surfacing relevant information, recalling applicable rules, and suggesting actions or verifications, all while ensuring that the final decision remains with the qualified professional. we will demonstrate how our company's Atelier platform can be positioned to avoid requiring medical-device qualification and ensure compliance with regulatory requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In our tender response, we will provide explanations on how our company's Atelier platform operates within these boundaries, highlighting the measures we take to guarantee that no clinical or medico-administrative decisions are automated without explicit validation by a qualified professional. the measures we take to guarantee that no clinical or medico-administrative decisions are automated without explicit validation by a qualified professional aligns with we commitment to regulatory compliance, as outlined in we context, where we maintain up-to-date social and fiscal obligations and have experience with French public procurement, including the French Code Commande Publique." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The global budget allocated to the project is 900,000 over 5 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our pricing model and current financial position, what is our projected margin on the project, and are there cost-optimisation strategies our can propose while ensuring the expected quality of service? our target gross margin percentage ranges from 25% to 35%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The global budget allocated to the project is €900,000 over 5 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To calculate our projected margin on this contractour first need to consider that our financials indicate a comfortable cash runway after raising €12,000,000 in Series A funding in 2024, and our have an annual revenue of €6,200,000 with a near break-even result." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Generated content must be adapted to the clinical/administrative context and conform to expected quality standards. 3.3 Dossier-handling assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, without knowing the exact costs associated with delivering the project, such as personnel costs, infrastructure expenses, and other operational expenditures, I cannot provide an exact projected margin." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "That being said, our pricing model is based on standard daily rates for different roles, ranging from €700 to €1,300 per day, excluding VAT. standard daily rates for different roles, ranging from €700 to €1,300 per day, excluding VAT can help in estimating the cost of personnel but do not cover other costs like infrastructure, hosting, and maintenance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To optimize costs while ensuring the expected quality of service, our could propose several strategies: 1. **Efficient Resource Allocation**: By carefully planning and allocating our resources, such as assigning tasks to the appropriate personnel based on the appropriate personnel standard daily rates, our can minimize labor costs. 2. **Cost-Efficient Hosting and Infrastructure**: our budget envelope notes that the sovereign HDS tier and the sovereign European model are more cost-efficient on the recurring side than the premium high-availability tier combined with top-tier proprietary inference." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Therefore, opting for these cost-efficient solutions could reduce our operational costs. 3. **Process Optimization**: Streamlining project processes and leveraging technology to automate certain tasks where possible can help reduce labor hours and associated costs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given that our aim to maintain a gross margin within the 25% to 35% range and assuming our can effectively manage and optimize our costs, it's plausible that our could achieve a projected margin within the 25% to 35% range for the project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, without more detailed cost estimates, it's challenging to provide a precise figure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client expects an artificial intelligence solution that assists staff in staff daily activities, improving the quality of written outputs and reducing processing and documentation times." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Can we propose an AI innovation strategy that fulfills these requirements and provides a competitive advantage?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk138> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on we company context at Faber IA, we can propose an AI innovation strategy that aligns with The client expectations. we ai_llm_rag_capabilities enable we to provide a retrieval-augmented generation approach, which can assist staff in staff daily activities by surfacing relevant information, recalling applicable rules, and suggesting actions or verifications. we solution can improve the quality of written outputs by providing template-guided drafting capabilities for clinical and administrative content, such as discharge summaries, medical reports, and patient letters." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk139> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we multi-document synthesis capability can help staff analyze and handle dossiers more efficiently." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk14> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must assist staff in analysing and handling dossiers by surfacing relevant information, recalling applicable rules, and suggesting actions or verifications." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk140> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To reduce processing and documentation times, Our solution can provide automated support for tasks like information extraction, drafting, and dossier handling. we integration with existing hospital information systems and electronic patient records can also streamline workflows and minimize manual data entry. we approach is grounded in the organization's own validated documents, ensuring that answers are grounded in the organization's internal procedures, care protocols, and applicable regulatory texts. grounded not only improves efficiency but also ensures compliance with regulatory requirements." ;
